<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices slightly up, ammonia steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices slightly up, ammonia steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were slightly higher Monday, as export business continued to boost prices, dealers said. Demand from India, China and Pakistan was noted, trade sources said.</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton	Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   180-182			up 1-2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     185-190			up 1-3</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   228-230			unc</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
